msgstr "仅指定高度（为 0）在需要暂停然后重新启动引导路径时很有用。以下命令将模式设为 HOLD，然后重新启动飞行器前往上一个目标点："

#: ../../source/docs/rover-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:108
#: 7ab56e08a2ed4820b7977c05fcef5a6e
msgid ""
"When you're finished you can return to the initial position by changing "
"to ``RTL`` mode (this also works in ``AUTO`` mode):"
msgstr "完成后，可以切换到 ``RTL`` 模式返回初始位置（``AUTO`` 模式下同样适用）："

#: ../../source/docs/rover-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:117
#: ac7b1ceebff8443880ad0bfb61e01f83
msgid "Running a mission"
msgstr "运行任务"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:119
#: 33e1b1615d5940a985bc4c5ac2191972
msgid ""
"You can load a mission at any time using the ``wp load`` command. After "
"you've taken off the current mission will start as soon as you change to "
"``AUTO`` mode."
msgstr "可随时使用 ``wp load`` 命令加载任务。起飞后，切换到 ``AUTO`` 模式后当前任务将立即开始执行。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:123
#: 22091a59489c4d94bf8ad306587155d7
msgid ""
"The example below shows how to load and start one of the test missions, "
"skip to the second waypoint, and *loop* the mission:"
msgstr "以下示例演示如何加载并启动一个测试任务、跳转到第二个航点，以及*循环*执行任务："

#: ../../source/docs/rover-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:135
#: 844abd2355bf4e30bb57a4eba7ed691b
msgid ""
"Rover will only run :ref:`commands it supports <rover:common-mavlink-"
"mission-command-messages-mav_cmd_commands_supported_by_rover>` (others "
"are ignored)."
msgstr ""
"Rover 只会执行 :ref:`其支持的命令 <rover:common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-"
"mav_cmd_commands_supported_by_rover>` （其他命令将被忽略）。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:138
#: 9617b84a4cfd440fa2353ead2378be3e
msgid ""
"The :ref:`MAVProxy Waypoints documentation <mavproxy:mavproxy-waypoints>`"
" lists the full set of available commands (or you can get them using "
"auto-completion by typing \"wp\" on the command line)."
msgstr ""
":ref:`MAVProxy 航点文档 <mavproxy:mavproxy-waypoints>` "
"列出了所有可用命令的完整集合（也可以在命令行输入「wp」通过自动补全获取）。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:142
#: 12298edf78d049bfbc8911d262245dc1
msgid ""
"If you want to create a waypoint mission, this is most easily done on the"
" map:"
msgstr "如果要创建航点任务，最简便的方法是在地图上操作："

#: ../../source/docs/rover-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:145
#: 0dcc4331a8d9476a9d89ab7bbd71acec
msgid "Right-click on the map and then select **Mission \\| Draw**."
msgstr "在地图上右键单击，然后选择 **任务 \\| 绘制**。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:150
#: 9b1c4b0f41e8452fbbaf05f3bd6005e9
msgid ""
"MAVProxy: Draw Mission Menu (This image is for Copter, but the behaviour "
"is the same)."
msgstr "MAVProxy：绘制任务菜单（此图示为 Copter，但操作相同）。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:152
#: b6c53acbaa864ae6a16bd9b5ab98b890
msgid "Left-click on the map where you want the points to appear."
msgstr "在地图上左键单击您希望航点出现的位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:156
#: 4e45d293061e4acda5428431187d45a4
msgid ""
"Nothing visible will happen when you make the first click. After the "
"second click, lines will join your points to show the path"
msgstr "第一次单击时不会有明显变化。第二次单击后，各点之间将出现连线以显示路径"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:159
#: b7daa9f765784f8cb9c5b7cc448e4d88
msgid ""
"When you're done, you can loop the mission by right-clicking on the map "
"and selecting **Mission \\| Loop**."
msgstr "完成后，可在地图上右键单击并选择 **任务 \\| 循环** 来设置任务循环执行。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:162
#: a5cb0aa6b37b46d895d18f556412a5e6
msgid ""
"This approach only allows you to create :ref:`MAV_CMD_NAV_WAYPOINT "
"<rover:mav_cmd_nav_waypoint>` commands. You can edit missions and use "
"other commands on Linux using the *misseditor* module (``module load "
"misseditor``). This is currently broken on Windows. It is also possible "
"to load other types of commands from files."
msgstr ""
"此方法仅允许创建 :ref:`MAV_CMD_NAV_WAYPOINT <rover:mav_cmd_nav_waypoint>` 命令。在 "
"Linux 上可以使用 *misseditor* 模块（``module load misseditor``）编辑任务和使用其他命令。该模块目前在"
" Windows 上无法使用。也可以从文件中加载其他类型的命令。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:171
#: 797c3fe5352b48dc986ec5ceb7b75259
msgid ""
"At any point you can pause the mission by setting the mode to ``HOLD``, "
"and restart by setting it back to ``AUTO``."
msgstr "您可以随时通过将模式设为 ``HOLD`` 来暂停任务，然后切换回 ``AUTO`` 重新启动。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:175
#: 3876ba11278c4a5f81c86e773dacdbbe
msgid "Changing mode"
msgstr "切换模式"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:177
#: c1a6311a9e1345ef9b009211ab29550f
msgid ""
"Rover supports a small number of modes which you can list in *MAVProxy* "
"with the ``mode`` command:"
msgstr "Rover 支持少量模式，可在 *MAVProxy* 中使用 ``mode`` 命令列出："

#: ../../source/docs/rover-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:185
#: 2b8dab62d83c46aebdb3bfc692cb8c3a
msgid "The useful modes for simulation are:"
msgstr "仿真中常用的模式有："

#: ../../source/docs/rover-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:187
#: 6f749bd964dc4e379d72cdc211d034f4
msgid "``AUTO`` - Run a mission"
msgstr "``AUTO`` - 执行任务"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:188
#: c0c261f6b16541c7b4b2d90fdded51cc
msgid "``GUIDED`` - Move where directed by GCS"
msgstr "``GUIDED`` - 按地面站指令移动"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:189
#: 112b154ea23540988b86a67ae8083afe
msgid "``RTL`` - Return to launch"
msgstr "``RTL`` - 返回起飞点"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:190
#: f74a881f7b784939a826fd58a6fa54af
msgid "``HOLD`` - WAIT - pause mission/stop moving."
msgstr "``HOLD`` - 等待——暂停任务/停止移动。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:192
#: f481bfc9958c443c888898d94bb1f751
msgid ""
"As shown in the previous section, you can change the mode by specifying "
"``mode modename``. Most of the modes can be set by just entering the mode"
" name, e.g. ``rtl``, ``auto``, ``hold``."
msgstr ""
"如上一节所示，可以通过 ``mode modename`` 切换模式。大多数模式可以直接输入模式名设置，例如 "
"``rtl``、``auto``、``hold``。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:197
#: 22b55e499f2e4c759316a3052bb72e97
msgid "Testing the vehicle"
msgstr "测试飞行器"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-sitlmavproxy-tutorial.rst:199
#: 0208df6a9e5341178cbe7811cb9854f8
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"*MAVProxy* allows you to list all the parameters affecting the vehicle "
"and simulation using ``param show *``, and to set any parameter using: "
"``param set PARAM_NAME VALUE``. In addition to affecting the vehicle "
"itself some parameters simulate the performance/failure of specific "
"hardware components and the environment (for example, the wind). These "
"can be listed using: .. code-block:: console"
msgstr ""
"*MAVProxy* 允许使用 ``param show *`` 列出影响飞行器和仿真的所有参数，并使用 ``param set "
"PARAM_NAME VALUE`` 设置任意参数。除影响飞行器本身外，某些参数可以仿真特定硬件组件的性能/故障及环境（例如风）。可使用 ` "
":ref:`param show sim*` ` 列出这些参数。主题「使用 SITL 进行 ArduPilot 测试 <using-sitl-"
"for-ardupilot-testing>」详细介绍了如何使用 SITL 进行测试。"

